      en: ["Established in 1974 as part of a national industrialization drive.", "Specializes in processing high-grade Togolese raw cotton.", "Located in Kara, the primary economic hub of northern Togo.", "Features integrated production from ginning to final weaving.", "Key regional employer providing jobs to hundreds of workers.", "Strategically situated near the RN1 highway for easy transport."],
